{
  "_comment": "How chat shorthand like '60% glove att' maps to Classic World scroll names. Classic World names scrolls '<Slot> <Stat> Scroll: <Tier>' (e.g. 'Gloves Attack Scroll: Intermediate' = 60%). Only 60 -> Intermediate is confirmed; add the others once you have checked them in game, e.g. \"100\": \"Lesser\". Percentages without a tier here are kept as '<Slot> <Stat> Scroll (N%)' so they never get a wrong name.",
  "name_format": "{slot} {stat} Scroll: {tier}",
  "fallback_format": "{slot} {stat} Scroll ({pct}%)",
